   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <opener>
                        <dateline>Sunday</dateline>
                    </opener>
                    <p>Dear Budgen: Can you come out here to dinner Tuesday evening? I hope to have your copy of <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">
                            <hi rend="underline">
                                <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">Ulysse</name>
                            </hi>
                        </seg> for you. It is out. If otherwise engaged please ring up.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">The French translation, <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">Ulysse</name>, was published in Paris by La Maison des Amis des Livres in February 1929.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
   </text>
